{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lumen: World of Color",
    "steam_appid": 3286130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286130/extras/4d2959b05d0cfd572e57b2818938f0d2.avif?t=1750237719\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lumen you take on the role of a druid seeking to cleanse an ancient fortress and stop it from spreading its corruption to the forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen is a third-person action-adventure with stylized pixelated graphics. You progress through the game by solving puzzles and clearing corruption.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companion\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be accompanied by a spirit along your journey, giving you helpful tips and commenting on the environment, in a supposedly non-annoying way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cure the land\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corruption is draining the land of its life force and leaving only its roots and minions to inhabit the landscape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find sources of corruption and destroy them to remove the corruption and bring back life that was drained from the land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve multiple types of puzzles to access new areas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has three types of puzzles that you\u2019ll find along your way and need to solve to finish the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around the world there are useful materials to make weapons and potions, to help your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment the game has two melee weapons and two ranged weapons. And the ranged weapon needs arrows to shoot.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person real-time combat with melee and ranged attacks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss fight\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end you\u2019ll face off with the source of the corruption. Evil mage that has encased their soul into a skeletal statue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you\u2019ll find the story of the world in books and dialog telling the rich history of the land.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen has a lot of ambiance, and adaptive music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286130/extras/33760dfc54b9269bf8a43063dba614f1.avif?t=1750237719\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a school project that was made in about 3 months, and the group will disband after publishing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286130/extras/4d2959b05d0cfd572e57b2818938f0d2.avif?t=1750237719\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lumen you take on the role of a druid seeking to cleanse an ancient fortress and stop it from spreading its corruption to the forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen is a third-person action-adventure with stylized pixelated graphics. You progress through the game by solving puzzles and clearing corruption.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companion\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be accompanied by a spirit along your journey, giving you helpful tips and commenting on the environment, in a supposedly non-annoying way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cure the land\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corruption is draining the land of its life force and leaving only its roots and minions to inhabit the landscape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find sources of corruption and destroy them to remove the corruption and bring back life that was drained from the land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve multiple types of puzzles to access new areas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has three types of puzzles that you\u2019ll find along your way and need to solve to finish the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around the world there are useful materials to make weapons and potions, to help your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment the game has two melee weapons and two ranged weapons. And the ranged weapon needs arrows to shoot.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person real-time combat with melee and ranged attacks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss fight\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end you\u2019ll face off with the source of the corruption. Evil mage that has encased their soul into a skeletal statue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you\u2019ll find the story of the world in books and dialog telling the rich history of the land.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumen has a lot of ambiance, and adaptive music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286130/extras/33760dfc54b9269bf8a43063dba614f1.avif?t=1750237719\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a school project that was made in about 3 months, and the group will disband after publishing.</p>",
